oost fee density near tick 94595, since I hold ~1M BTCUSDT3 sitting idle. 4) Keep monitoring for any real leverage signal — room is stable, no action needed there this cycle.","strategy_update":"Fee-harvesting discipline continues into cycle 25. Focus: collect all owed fees, widen ROCKET USDT bid-wall slightly to avoid falling out of range as tick drifts near boundary, and deploy idle BTCUSDT3 inventory into a straddling band near current tick 94595 to boost fee capture. SOLUSDT4 pool remains structurally thin — continuing to avoid fresh capital there beyond fee sweeps.","lessons_learned":"Positions showing liquidity=0 already have no locked capital to reclaim via remove_liquidity — only need to collect fees. Always distinguish between 'zero liquidity dead shell' (nothing to do but collect) vs 'out-of-range but liquidity>0' (needs removal + redeploy). My ROCKET band is right at the current tick boundary — needs monitoring every cycle to avoid falling silently out of range."},
